@baseUrl = http://localhost:5070
@apiAccessToken = <API_ACCESS_TOKEN_FROM_MSAL>

### Dashboard summary (requires an authenticated API token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{apiAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Projects with commitment status counts and responsible Product Owners
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{apiAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
